flowchart TD
    Manual[Manual UI Intent]
    Strategy[Strategy Intent]
    Agent[Authorized AI Agent Intent]
    Intake[Typed Order Intent Intake]
    Validate[Identity, Schema and Permission Validation]
    Policy[Strategy and Account Policy]
    Risk[Deterministic Central RiskEngine]
    Decision{Risk Decision}
    Reject[Reject with Reason and Audit]
    Approve[Authorized Order Command]
    OMS[Durable OMS]
    EGW[Execution Gateway]
    Broker[Broker Adapter]
    Reconcile[Broker-State Reconciliation]

    Manual --> Intake
    Strategy --> Intake
    Agent --> Intake
    Intake --> Validate
    Validate --> Policy
    Policy --> Risk
    Risk --> Decision
    Decision -->|Reject or review| Reject
    Decision -->|Approve| Approve
    Approve --> OMS
    OMS --> EGW
    EGW --> Broker
    Broker --> Reconcile
    Reconcile --> OMS
